{"id":"n47221-1-4","stage":5,"title":"동성 · 同性","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n47221-1-4-1","ko":"오늘 누구 만나? 너 또 다른 남자 만나지?","zh":"今天要见谁啊？你又去见别的男人了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누구","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나?","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남자","meaning":"男人","explanation":"남자：男人","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"3","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나지?","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男人","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"一个女人的丈夫或恋人。","pronunciation":["남자"]}],"audio":"/audio/5643d8ca2970f4a3acfa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n47221-1-4-2","ko":"아니야. 동성 친구 만나니까 걱정 마.","zh":"不是的。我是要见同性朋友，别担心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니야.","meaning":"不是，不对","explanation":"아니야：不是，不对","readings":[{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29726","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동성","meaning":"同性","explanation":"동성：同性","readings":[{"term":"동성","audio":"/audio/0adb9872a36b848ad09d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47221","senseId":"1","lemma":"동성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"친구","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId"